  "body": "Step into refined, low-maintenance luxury residence perfectly positioned in one of Orewa’s most desirable enclaves - Ara Hills. Offering generous proportions, thoughtful design, and effortless modern living, this stunning five-bedroom home is ideal for families, professionals, or those seeking a premium coastal lifestyle. \r\n\r\nPremium Features\r\n\r\nDesigned Elegance\r\nWith clean lines, quality finishes and a beautifully considered layout, this home delivers comfort, style, and functional living across two expansive levels. Based on approx 453m2 of freehold land and 251m2 of floor area. \r\n\r\nFlexible Multi-Level Floorplan\r\n\r\nDownstairs:\r\n\r\n• 2 spacious bedrooms\r\n• A private lounge—ideal for extended family, teens, or guests\r\n• Full bathroom\r\n• Double internal-access garage\r\n\r\n\r\nUpstairs:\r\n\r\n• 3 additional bedrooms including a luxurious master suite\r\n• 2.5 bathrooms in total (including ensuite and powder room)\r\n• Expansive open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area\r\n• Light-filled spaces perfect for family gatherings and entertaining\r\n\r\n\r\nOpen-Plan Living at Its Best\r\nThe designer kitchen anchors the main living zone, flowing seamlessly to sun-soaked living and dining spaces—perfect for relaxed evenings or hosting friends.\r\n\r\n\r\nLow-Maintenance, Executive Lifestyle\r\nEnjoy more time living and less time maintaining with easy-care landscaping and modern construction, delivering peace of mind and a lock-up-and-leave option for busy lifestyles.\r\n\r\nThis is a home that offers space, style and Coastal Convenience, Located in sought-after Ara Hills  just moments from beaches, walkways, cafés, schools and transport links, this exceptional property combines coastal charm with contemporary comfort.\r\n\r\nCall me now to start you new lifestyle",
